window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ash falls from the sky as Euddán and Vounée sail the turbulent seas.</b></p> <p>The city of Kenl Ruet reels from Lady Shadow's attack, and Duke Phaos will hunt down those responsible. Only problem, he believes Vounée, Euddán, and their friends are in cahoots with the return of the dragon.</p> <p>Fleeing by ship, Euddán and Vounée need to continue their quest. They have to save another dragon egg from an underwater volcano. This will be a deadly and dangerous task for Vounée as she risks everything to free another dragon.</p> <p>Duke Phaos, armed with deadly priests and a dark warlock, sail after. He won't let anything stand in the way of bringing Euddán and his friends to justice.</p> <p>As ash falls from the sky and volcanic fumes choke the air, Duke Phaos pounces.</p> <p>Will Euddán and his friends survive the ambush?</p> <p>You have to listen to this exciting, epic fantasy tale because of the depths of the characters! You will fall in love with Euddan, Vounee, Zai, Ruan, and the rest!</p> <p><b>Download now to embark on the adventure of a lifetime!</b></p>"; 
